@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam monochrome true
title Task 3 - Brick Buster Python class design
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
class BrickBusterApp {
  - services; session_result: BuildResult?
  + show_screen(screen, context)
  + on_collection_or_import_change()
  + show_feedback(kind, message)
}
class Screens {
  - current_screen: str; context: dict
  - widgets: dict[str, Widget]
  + show(screen_id, context); back()
  + submit(action, fields); render_state(state)
}
class DatabaseManager {
  - path: Path; generation: int
  + transaction(); read(query, params)
  + catalogue_ready(): bool
  + commit(); rollback(); close()
}
class DataImporter {
  - db: DatabaseManager
  + validate_files(folder)
  + stage_and_validate_graph(folder)
  + normalize_inventory_ownership()
  + publish_atomically()
}
class SetService {
  - db: DatabaseManager
  + search_sets(text, theme?, year?)
  + get_set(set_num)
  + list_themes(); list_years()
}
class CollectionService {
  - db; resolver: InventoryResolver
  + add_set(set_num, quantity)
  + list_owned_sets()
  + update_quantity(set_num, quantity)
  + remove_set(set_num)
  + get_piece_quantity(part_num, color_id)
}
class BuildService {
  - collection; resolver: InventoryResolver
  + check_target(set_num): BuildResult
  + missing_items(result): list[Shortage]
}
class InventoryResolver {
  - db: DatabaseManager
  + select_inventory(owner): Inventory
  + resolve_set(set_num, path): ItemPool
  + aggregate_owned(entries): ItemPool
  + validate_disjoint_contents(inventory)
}
class BuildResult {
  + target: str; status: BuildStatus
  + generation: int
  + rows: list[Shortage]
}
class ItemPool {
  + parts: dict[tuple[str, int], int]
  + minifigs: dict[str, int]
  + scaled(copies): ItemPool
  + add(other: ItemPool)
}
class Shortage {
  + item_type: str; identifier: str
  + name: str; color: str?
  + required: int; available: int
  + missing: int
}
BrickBusterApp "1" *-- "1" Screens
BrickBusterApp --> DataImporter
BrickBusterApp --> SetService
BrickBusterApp --> CollectionService
BrickBusterApp --> BuildService
DataImporter --> DatabaseManager
SetService --> DatabaseManager
CollectionService --> DatabaseManager
CollectionService --> InventoryResolver
BuildService --> CollectionService
BuildService --> InventoryResolver
InventoryResolver --> DatabaseManager
BuildService ..> BuildResult : produces
InventoryResolver ..> ItemPool : produces
BuildResult "1" *-- "0..*" Shortage : rows
note bottom of Screens
  See wireframe IDs S01-S08 and D01-D02.
  UC09 extends UC08 only when there are shortages.
  Screens call services via app event handlers.
end note
note bottom of InventoryResolver
  Choose one max-version inventory per owner.
  Validate graph, path cycles and direct/nested provenance.
  Memoize one-copy set pools; multiply along each edge.
  Aggregate complete fig_num counts; do not expand figures.
  Missing or ambiguous data raises DataError.
end note
note bottom of BuildService
  required = resolver.resolve_set(target) for one copy.
  available = resolver.aggregate_owned(collection.list_owned_sets()).
  missing = max(required - available, 0).
  Buildable only if every shortage is zero.
  Invalidate result after collection edits or successful import.
  BuildStatus = BUILDABLE / NOT_BUILDABLE.
  DataError or ValidationError gives a message, not a result.
end note
@enduml
